  const R = GX.xr; const EX = ['Which G10 currencies have weakened most against the dollar this quarter?', 'Find emerging-market currencies where real yields are high but reserves are falling.', 'Compare the Mexican peso, Brazilian real and South African rand using carry, volatility, and drawdown.', 'Which currencies have diverged most from their historical relationship with oil prices?', 'How did USD/NGN behave around previous FX policy changes?', 'Compare current exchange rates with their REER histories and show the limitations of each comparison.', 'Which of my portfolio holdings are most exposed to a 10% depreciation in the local currency?', "Write a research memo explaining this week's major FX moves."];
