    <section class="panel c6"><header class="ph"><span class="pt">How data flows</span></header><div class="pb stu-guide"><ul><li><b>Economic series</b> appear in Country data. Set "Feeds macro indicator" (CPI, GDP, POL, UR…) and, for the 20 economies in Economic indicators, your values replace the simulated ones from your first date.</li><li><b>Derived indicators</b> (year-on-year, moving averages, ratios, spreads, real values, rebased indices, z-score composites) are recalculated automatically when inputs change.</li><li><b>Prices</b> for existing instruments override simulated and web-sourced values on the same dates. Unknown tickers become new instruments you can chart, watch and compare.</li><li><b>News</b> appears in Market news and Country data; <b>events</b> in Market calendars; <b>research</b> in the Research library and Market news.</li><li><b>Private companies, rounds and funds</b> join Private companies, Deal flow and Fund performance.</li></ul></div></section>
